(6480761, 963824, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun image with a space like feeling. The flower front and center has a green cast to it that is distracting me as I look at this photo.</td>', 'Fun image with a space like feeling. The flower front and center has a green cast to it that is distracting me as I look at this photo.', '2011-07-25 11:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480762, 963829, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and great use of depth. I wonder what it would have looked like if your light source was blue to indicate electricity a bit more.</td>', 'Nice setup and great use of depth. I wonder what it would have looked like if your light source was blue to indicate electricity a bit more.', '2011-07-25 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480763, 963792, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect and perfectly lit. I hope this does well.</td>', 'Very cool effect and perfectly lit. I hope this does well.', '2011-07-25 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480764, 963672, 114225, '<td valign="top">A decent idea, but I feel like it''s just a bit sloppy for my tastes. For instance, I don''t think the vertical parts on the cross bar add anything unless you would have traced the entire structure. Also, I feel like there is a net missing.</td>', 'A decent idea, but I feel like it''s just a bit sloppy for my tastes. For instance, I don''t think the vertical parts on the cross bar add anything unless you would have traced the entire structure. Also, I feel like there is a net missing.', '2011-07-25 12:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480765, 963736, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like the combination of blue and orange used.</td>', 'Well done. I like the combination of blue and orange used.', '2011-07-25 12:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480766, 963821, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject, but I don''t think the lighting does it justice. I would challenge you to return to this spot with these ideas and see what you get:<br/>1) Try a more dramatic lighting instead of attempting to light the whole scene<br/>2) Light from inside the shack. With the cracks and holes I bet you could get some really cool<br/>3) Smoke pouring out of the door (e.g. a smoke machine) would be really spooky and cool.</td>', 'This is a great subject, but I don''t think the lighting does it justice. I would challenge you to return to this spot with these ideas and see what you get:1) Try a more dramatic lighting instead of attempting to light the whole scene2) Light from inside the shack. With the cracks and holes I bet you could get some really cool3) Smoke pouring out of the door (e.g. a smoke machine) would be really spooky and cool.', '2011-07-25 12:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480767, 963688, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I like the wispiness (not a real word) of the light.</td>', 'Great idea. I like the wispiness (not a real word) of the light.', '2011-07-25 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480768, 963757, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the interplay of light vs shadows that you created.</td>', 'I like the interplay of light vs shadows that you created.', '2011-07-25 12:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6480769, 963814, 114225, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. I bet she really like the end result.</td>', 'Fun shot. I bet she really like the end result.', '2011-07-25 12:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
