(6482281, 963357, 47470, '<td valign="top">Since this is Advanced Editing, I would have preferred if you had used two layers to have two white balances--one with the sky as is and one to correct for the yellow light on the bottom.  That sickly yellow light always makes nature look dead to me.  Dunno; maybe that''s what you were going for, but if it was, you could have used a different title that would have made that more clear.  I assume you weren''t though : )  Some sharpening would have helped too, I think.</td>', 'Since this is Advanced Editing, I would have preferred if you had used two layers to have two white balances--one with the sky as is and one to correct for the yellow light on the bottom.  That sickly yellow light always makes nature look dead to me.  Dunno; maybe that''s what you were going for, but if it was, you could have used a different title that would have made that more clear.  I assume you weren''t though : )  Some sharpening would have helped too, I think.', '2011-07-27 11:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6482352, 963805, 57447, '<td valign="top">This is nice.</td>', 'This is nice.', '2011-07-27 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
