(6484128, 963731, 136232, '<td valign="top">Looks like the light of a ghost motorcycle.  Cropping out the bear branches of the right side (distracts from the piece) would make this a pretty awesome post-card of a road trip.</td>', 'Looks like the light of a ghost motorcycle.  Cropping out the bear branches of the right side (distracts from the piece) would make this a pretty awesome post-card of a road trip.', '2011-07-29 14:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484129, 963713, 136232, '<td valign="top">Using a smaller/less diffued light would give you a more defined Z.</td>', 'Using a smaller/less diffued light would give you a more defined Z.', '2011-07-29 14:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484131, 963657, 136232, '<td valign="top">Cropping out (not all) some of the blackness to the left of the face would bring more attention to the face itself. It would also disrupt the balance of 50%black, 50%with light, which tends to make the eye focus more on the art piece.</td>', 'Cropping out (not all) some of the blackness to the left of the face would bring more attention to the face itself. It would also disrupt the balance of 50%black, 50%with light, which tends to make the eye focus more on the art piece.', '2011-07-29 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484132, 963757, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love how the angle of the lighting gives the bare minimum detail.  I can definitely tell it is an uke with the detail given, but the shapes made from the light itself are interesting on their own. The wood portion looks so clean with unbroken slopes that if the guitar strings were wound slightly cleaner then it would have a more modern feel.</td>', 'I love how the angle of the lighting gives the bare minimum detail.  I can definitely tell it is an uke with the detail given, but the shapes made from the light itself are interesting on their own. The wood portion looks so clean with unbroken slopes that if the guitar strings were wound slightly cleaner then it would have a more modern feel.', '2011-07-29 14:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484133, 963822, 136232, '<td valign="top">If there was a difference of texture (light of grass and then bush/tree) or a play on sharpening focus of an area and defocussing on other areas could help create a more interesting piece.  Also, if you have two people in interesting positions, and light them from behind with a stronger light, the shadows on the grass could look like the shadows of monsters creeping in the night.</td>', 'If there was a difference of texture (light of grass and then bush/tree) or a play on sharpening focus of an area and defocussing on other areas could help create a more interesting piece.  Also, if you have two people in interesting positions, and light them from behind with a stronger light, the shadows on the grass could look like the shadows of monsters creeping in the night.', '2011-07-29 14:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484134, 963672, 136232, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more interesting, if instead of the goalpost being illuminated, that instead there would be a bouncing light coming from outside the left frame to the goalie, so it looks like the path of a soccer ball being blocked at the last minute.</td>', 'I think this would be more interesting, if instead of the goalpost being illuminated, that instead there would be a bouncing light coming from outside the left frame to the goalie, so it looks like the path of a soccer ball being blocked at the last minute.', '2011-07-29 14:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484135, 963814, 136232, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece, my only nitpick is the light looses it''s three-dimensionality  at the very top- it looks like the vortex bends backwards the 2 loop from the top.</td>', 'Interesting piece, my only nitpick is the light looses it''s three-dimensionality  at the very top- it looks like the vortex bends backwards the 2 loop from the top.', '2011-07-29 14:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484136, 963833, 136232, '<td valign="top">Wonderful nostalgia piece.  The light in the background gives a ghostly sense of movement, whereas in the foreground creates a path of the car.  All items, the board, the car, the house, are all obviously stationary, but the use of light gives a sense of movement to them all.  I even love the house/hotel piece, which looks like a faded memory.</td>', 'Wonderful nostalgia piece.  The light in the background gives a ghostly sense of movement, whereas in the foreground creates a path of the car.  All items, the board, the car, the house, are all obviously stationary, but the use of light gives a sense of movement to them all.  I even love the house/hotel piece, which looks like a faded memory.', '2011-07-29 14:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484137, 963795, 136232, '<td valign="top">A slight angle, either from the top down to see the interesting patterns comming from the light through the bottom of the glass, or just slightly to the side would help bring out the texture of the glass.  Right now it''s an interesting shape, but looks flattened with texture instead of enhanced.</td>', 'A slight angle, either from the top down to see the interesting patterns comming from the light through the bottom of the glass, or just slightly to the side would help bring out the texture of the glass.  Right now it''s an interesting shape, but looks flattened with texture instead of enhanced.', '2011-07-29 14:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484138, 963585, 136232, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter.  Implies a story of cyborg pelicans coming to the city, discussing their plans to take over the world.  My only nitpick (and this might sound incredibly nitpicky) is if you angled it ever so slightly more, so the slight shadow line on the right edge of the picture on the water is cropped out, it would give the water a greater sense of three-dimensionality and give the pelicans a greater sense of space in relation to the bridge.</td>', 'Interesting subject matter.  Implies a story of cyborg pelicans coming to the city, discussing their plans to take over the world.  My only nitpick (and this might sound incredibly nitpicky) is if you angled it ever so slightly more, so the slight shadow line on the right edge of the picture on the water is cropped out, it would give the water a greater sense of three-dimensionality and give the pelicans a greater sense of space in relation to the bridge.', '2011-07-29 14:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484139, 963829, 136232, '<td valign="top">Creative use of light. Helps to emphasize the electric component of the guitar. Love the composition.</td>', 'Creative use of light. Helps to emphasize the electric component of the guitar. Love the composition.', '2011-07-29 14:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484140, 962953, 136232, '<td valign="top">Creative use of light for a skeleton body.  Would like to see slightly more detail in background, so it looks like it is something that takes up space instead of something which is floating within space.</td>', 'Creative use of light for a skeleton body.  Would like to see slightly more detail in background, so it looks like it is something that takes up space instead of something which is floating within space.', '2011-07-29 14:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484141, 963823, 136232, '<td valign="top">This is the part in the movie where lightning strikes the guitar and it suddenly comes to life!</td>', 'This is the part in the movie where lightning strikes the guitar and it suddenly comes to life!', '2011-07-29 14:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484142, 963637, 136232, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''re referencing a 007 movie.</td>', 'Looks like you''re referencing a 007 movie.', '2011-07-29 14:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484143, 963656, 136232, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting done in pastels on black.  How did you get this effect?  Nice gritty texture.</td>', 'Looks like a painting done in pastels on black.  How did you get this effect?  Nice gritty texture.', '2011-07-29 14:06:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6484144, 963619, 136232, '<td valign="top">Would be more interesting you could have made the light on the left turn into a patronus (plus get more nerdy votes from Potter fans)</td>', 'Would be more interesting you could have made the light on the left turn into a patronus (plus get more nerdy votes from Potter fans)', '2011-07-29 14:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484145, 963624, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love how the light isn''t just circling, but actually becomes part of the central piece within the photo.  Obvious use of moving laser.  The redness gives the sense that the tequila will either have a fiery taste, or has some magical property as a love potion.</td>', 'I love how the light isn''t just circling, but actually becomes part of the central piece within the photo.  Obvious use of moving laser.  The redness gives the sense that the tequila will either have a fiery taste, or has some magical property as a love potion.', '2011-07-29 14:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484146, 963296, 136232, '<td valign="top">I would either crop out the light on the right, or give the figure on the left slightly more light.  Right now the white squiggly on the right takes all of your focus because it is so bright, but doesn''t seem to give more information to the picture (like an ancient scroll/bottle this druid ghost is trying to protect).</td>', 'I would either crop out the light on the right, or give the figure on the left slightly more light.  Right now the white squiggly on the right takes all of your focus because it is so bright, but doesn''t seem to give more information to the picture (like an ancient scroll/bottle this druid ghost is trying to protect).', '2011-07-29 14:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484147, 963819, 136232, '<td valign="top">Would add humor and help with the title if there was a silhouette of a woman''s high heeled foot/feet sticking up from the backseat of the car.</td>', 'Would add humor and help with the title if there was a silhouette of a woman''s high heeled foot/feet sticking up from the backseat of the car.', '2011-07-29 14:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484150, 963813, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and textures of this photo!  An aged quality to it, makes me think of an ancient temple altar.</td>', 'I love the composition and textures of this photo!  An aged quality to it, makes me think of an ancient temple altar.', '2011-07-29 14:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484151, 962998, 136232, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Would''ve liked to see the heart show up a bit more clearly, or possibly having the reflection of the blinds more in the center of the heart to help contrast it with the rest of the mirror</td>', 'Cute idea.  Would''ve liked to see the heart show up a bit more clearly, or possibly having the reflection of the blinds more in the center of the heart to help contrast it with the rest of the mirror', '2011-07-29 14:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484152, 963688, 136232, '<td valign="top">Ghostly.</td>', 'Ghostly.', '2011-07-29 14:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484153, 963767, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love how you sued multiple light points, which gives more three-dimensionality to the light encircling the glass.</td>', 'I love how you sued multiple light points, which gives more three-dimensionality to the light encircling the glass.', '2011-07-29 14:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484155, 963517, 136232, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail looks more interesting than the full size pic.  Slightly more definition/focus might help the viewer see the pairs in the light/fence</td>', 'The thumbnail looks more interesting than the full size pic.  Slightly more definition/focus might help the viewer see the pairs in the light/fence', '2011-07-29 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484157, 963835, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the sense that you aren''t sure what you''re looking at.  The light at the right might look better sloping from the bottom, right up, to mirror what looks like a path in the middle of the picture.</td>', 'I like the sense that you aren''t sure what you''re looking at.  The light at the right might look better sloping from the bottom, right up, to mirror what looks like a path in the middle of the picture.', '2011-07-29 14:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484159, 963805, 136232, '<td valign="top">Beautiful still-life.</td>', 'Beautiful still-life.', '2011-07-29 14:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484220, 963833, 68586, '<td valign="top">Really strong shot - very nice</td>', 'Really strong shot - very nice', '2011-07-29 14:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484357, 963683, 63244, '<td valign="top">Nice suit!! :P</td>', 'Nice suit!! :P', '2011-07-29 16:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
