(6484465, 963826, 132996, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous. I love the sepia tone and intense grunge look. The bands of light bring it together.</td>', 'This is gorgeous. I love the sepia tone and intense grunge look. The bands of light bring it together.', '2011-07-29 18:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484466, 963760, 132996, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. There are little magical things happening everywhere in this photo.</td>', 'Gorgeous. There are little magical things happening everywhere in this photo.', '2011-07-29 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484471, 963296, 132996, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image screams horror. The ghost on the right, the distorted face and eye, even the innocent hat in the background.</td>', 'Everything about this image screams horror. The ghost on the right, the distorted face and eye, even the innocent hat in the background.', '2011-07-29 18:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484472, 963685, 132996, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on his face. He looks most displeased by the spectacle.</td>', 'I love the expression on his face. He looks most displeased by the spectacle.', '2011-07-29 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484481, 963736, 106349, '<td valign="top">Great shot (REALLY great shot) but I honestly don''t see a non-stationary light source. Does he have a flashlight?</td>', 'Great shot (REALLY great shot) but I honestly don''t see a non-stationary light source. Does he have a flashlight?', '2011-07-29 18:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484512, 963821, 108069, '<td valign="top">There are a few in this challenge that are quite good, and many that have done quite well on the creativity front, but this is my favorite.<br/> <br/>It''s my kind of shot for starters, but there''s an earthy vibe that''s just real. Light trails can be interesting, but this is what i think of when I think painting with light. It''s a great scene and the processing is well done. The shed seems painting-like, but grounded in its realistic surroundings.<br/> <br/>Just a very interesting and well-done photo in every way.</td>', 'There are a few in this challenge that are quite good, and many that have done quite well on the creativity front, but this is my favorite. It''s my kind of shot for starters, but there''s an earthy vibe that''s just real. Light trails can be interesting, but this is what i think of when I think painting with light. It''s a great scene and the processing is well done. The shed seems painting-like, but grounded in its realistic surroundings. Just a very interesting and well-done photo in every way.', '2011-07-29 19:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484521, 963389, 106349, '<td valign="top">Non-stationary light source?</td>', 'Non-stationary light source?', '2011-07-29 20:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
