(6486396, 963814, 125659, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the great comments and the constructive criticism. That was a fun challenge to do and I have to thank my girlfriend for sitting still for about an hour while I experimented with my ideas. I was surprised she didn''t actually fall asleep sitting up.</td>', 'Thank you all for the great comments and the constructive criticism. That was a fun challenge to do and I have to thank my girlfriend for sitting still for about an hour while I experimented with my ideas. I was surprised she didn''t actually fall asleep sitting up.', '2011-08-01 01:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
