(6486634, 963792, 117474, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the lighting behind her head!<br/>I also think this is the best example in the challenge of painting with light supporting the subject. Most of the other lighting seemed incidental and put in to meet the challenge to me. This lighting makes this image. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-01 07:19:53.</i></td>', 'Very nice. Love the lighting behind her head!I also think this is the best example in the challenge of painting with light supporting the subject. Most of the other lighting seemed incidental and put in to meet the challenge to me. This lighting makes this image. ', '2011-08-01 08:18:06.000000', '2011-08-01 08:19:53.000000', 0),
