(6494568, 963792, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit late in my congrats, but I''m glad that I went back to the challenge to finally leave some.<br/> <br/>What great notes!! I never would have though of covering up my subject for half of the shot. I would have thought of anchoring the light to get a good arc. etc, etc. Fascinating reading, and thanks for sharing!!</td>', 'I''m a bit late in my congrats, but I''m glad that I went back to the challenge to finally leave some. What great notes!! I never would have though of covering up my subject for half of the shot. I would have thought of anchoring the light to get a good arc. etc, etc. Fascinating reading, and thanks for sharing!!', '2011-08-05 18:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
